lass=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover new surprises as you venture beyond Elysia.\u00a0 Face a variety of cards, perks, and enemies that challenge your skills and ensure every run feels unique.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Befriend Unique Characters</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage with diverse personalities through compelling conversations, and uncover the secrets of Elysia and the mysterious fog that surrounds the city.\u00a0 Will you be able to rally humanity to stand against the escalating machine threat?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331400/extras/Rogue-Drone-Hunter_Friends.gif?t=1744414921\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Tactical Terrain</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience fully destructible terrain and objects.\u00a0 Take cover in bushes or demolish structures to gain the advantage. Surprise your foes by setting off explosive traps and turning the battlefield to your favor.</p>","developers":["Sky Reverie"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331400/header.jpg?t=1744414921","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2025 - Sky Reverie","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257125123,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125123/movie480.mp4?t=1744412684","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125123/movie_max.mp4?t=1744412684"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257125123/6a32cfffc1c96fdc29294f1c0f9e056a6c9748a2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744412684","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125123/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744412684","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_t